              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan jed'e, Worri Edomu worra Yuda aka hama haalo baafate, akanaani wollaala hama keesa ufi buuse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi amma AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan jed'u, Anini worra suniti kae namafi saa worrale balleesa. Anini dira Tamariti fuud'e, dira Dedaniti d'aabe, lafa ch'ufa balleese ona tolche, achiti nami hedduleeni woraanaani hobaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gumiini tiyya ta Israeli worra Edomu haate haalo naa baafti, ammalle waan dallansuuni tiyya nama tolchitule worra garsiifti. Duuba akanaani worri Edomu aka anini haalo baafad'e arga. Nami dubbi tana jed'e AABBO Waaqa gudda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
